2025-10-08 12:28:05,326 [WARNING] Skipped idx=180: gold or llm supporting sentence is empty. gold='', llm='Supporting sentence: In humans, three TAp73 isoforms have been identified: TAp73α, TAp73β, and TAp73γ. These isoforms are produced through alternative splicing of the TP73 gene and differ in their N-terminus sequences. They are known to play roles in various cellular processes, including apoptosis, cell cycle regulation, and transcriptional modulation. The differential effects of p53 isoforms on these TAp73 variants, particularly in terms of complex formation and functional modulation, suggest a nuanced role in cancer development and other cellular pathologies.'
