2025-10-08 12:28:07,772 [WARNING] Skipped idx=816: gold or llm supporting sentence is empty. gold='', llm='Supporting sentence: In humans, three TAp73 isoforms have been identified: TAp73α, TAp73β, and TAp73γ. These isoforms are generated through alternative splicing of the TP73 gene and are known to play roles in cell cycle regulation, particularly in the G1/S and G2/M checkpoints, and in the spindle assembly checkpoint (SAC). The tumor-suppressive functions of TAp73 isoforms, as indicated in TAp73(-/-) mice, suggest that these isoforms are involved in maintaining genomic stability and preventing the development of tumors. The interaction of TAp73 with SAC proteins, such as Bub1, Bub3, and BubR1, further supports its role in regulating mitosis and meiosis, and its loss may contribute to the genomic instability and aneuploidy observed in TAp73-deficient cells.'
